  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Drain corn kernels.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64f92f37efa78cf7bc58a0f0-420ff8b7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook corn, pre-chopped onion and red kidney beans until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Reduce heat to medium-high, then add a drizzle more olive oil (if needed), tomato paste, garlic paste and Mexican Fiesta spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water and stir to combine. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64f92f37efa78cf7bc58a0f0-9182f02a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Arrange mini flourtortillas on a lined oven tray. Divide the bean mixture among the tortillas, spooning it onto one half of each tortilla, then top with Cheddar cheese.\n• Fold the other half of each tortilla over to close and press down gently with a spatula. Brush with a drizzle of olive oil (or spray with olive oil spray).\n• Bake the quesadillas until the cheese is melted and the tortillas are golden, 10-12 minutes. Spoon any overflowing filling back into the quesadillas. TIP: You can place a sheet of baking paper and a second oven tray on top of the quesadillas if they unfold during cooking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64f92f37efa78cf7bc58a0f0-56ecb12d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the quesadillas are baking, roughly chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, tomato and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste In a small bowl, combine the mild chipotle sauce and light sour cream.\n• Divide the quesadillas between plates. Serve with chipotle sour cream and salsa. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64f92f37efa78cf7bc58a0f0-a6f52bea.jpeg"
    }
  ]
